[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほう？\u3000ヤンネに休暇を楽しんでもらいたいんだな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So you want to make sure Janne has a good time on her vacation, do you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はいっす。\nでも、どうしたらいいかなーって悩んでて……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's the idea. We're just not sure how to go about it..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はっはっは！！\u3000簡単なことではないか。\nそれなら余と千歳が手を貸そう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ha ha ha!! That sounds simple enough to me. Then Chitose and I shall lend you a hand!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ケイウンには「おもてなし」の文化がございます。\nもしかしたら、皆様のお役に立てるかと……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Keiun has a strong culture of hospitality. Perhaps we might be of some help to you all..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それは心強い。けど、いいの？\n二人も行楽に来ているんじゃ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's reassuring. But are you sure? You two came here for the holidays as well..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よいよい。お前たちには借りがあるからな。\nそれに、楽しそうではないか！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Think nothing of it. We owe you all a debt besides. And it sounds like fun!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "誰かを喜ばすために動くのは大好きだ！\nこれも１つの良き休暇の過ごし方だな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I love finding ways to bring joy to others! What better way to spend a holiday than this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これも休暇……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This too... is a holiday..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鏑矢さんも千歳も、ありがとう！\nそれじゃ、お言葉に甘えて！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you both so much! Well then, we'll gladly take you up on the offer!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うむ、このへんが良さそうだ。\nここで場を整えよう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mm, this spot looks promising. Let us set things up here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "必要なものは島で貸し出しているみたいです。\n借りてきましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It seems the island has equipment available to borrow. I'll go and fetch what we need."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よいしょっと……こんな感じ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "There we go... How's this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん、いい感じじゃん？\n海辺の休息といえば、ずばりコレ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, that looks great! This is exactly what you picture when you think of a seaside retreat!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "コレ、とは？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This... is what you picture?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "水着でのーんびり、寝転がってくつろぐんだよ。\nここに冷たい飲み物も用意すれば完璧だね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lounging around in your swimsuit, just taking it easy. Add some cold drinks and it'll be perfect!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、場だけ整えてもどうするの？\nヤンネさんをここに呼べばいい？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But setting the scene alone isn't enough, is it? Should we go and fetch Janne?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ああ。こんな素敵な場所を用意されたら、\nくつろがないわけにもいくまい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. How could anyone resist relaxing in such a lovely spot?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……強引な理論",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Somewhat forceful logic."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふ。そうですね。\nでも、ヤンネ様はお優しい方ですから……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe. I suppose so. But Janne is such a kind soul..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん。一緒に楽しんでほしいって\nアタシたちの気持ち、きっと分かってくれるはず！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Exactly. She'll understand that we just want everyone to have fun together—I'm sure of it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "じゃあ、早速ヤンネさんを呼びに――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then let's go and get her—"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "待て",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Wait."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今のままでも、もてなしには十分だと思うが……\nうーむ、もう１つ何か欲しいな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is already more than enough to make for a fine welcome... and yet, I feel it needs one more touch."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "冷たーい飲み物なら、用意するっすよ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I could put together some cold drinks, if that helps?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いや、そうではない。\n……千歳！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, that is not it. ...Chitose!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "は、はい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-yes?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ひとつ、舞ってみてくれぬか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Would you do us the honor of a dance?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ど、どうでしょうか……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "H-how was that...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "愛い……愛いぞ！\nこれこそ、最高のもてなしではないか！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Exquisite... simply exquisite! Now this is true hospitality at its finest!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おもてなし関係なく、鏑矢さんが見たいだけじゃ……\nでもこれは確かに、心惹かれるものがありますなぁ～",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I think you just wanted to see her dance for yourself... But I have to admit, there is something captivating about it~"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様姉様、私だって踊れるわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina, Alvina—I can dance too, you know."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お？\u3000なになに～……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh? Go on then~..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この踊り、姉様に捧げる……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This dance... is for you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お、おお……？\nベップ、それは？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh... oh my...? Bepp, what is that?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おお！\u3000なんだその面妖な踊りは！！\n初めて見たぞ！\u3000余にも教えてくれ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh ho! What manner of spirited dance is this?! I've never seen anything like it! You must teach me!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ、もちろん。\nコツは、腰を落として力強く、よ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course. The key is to drop your stance low and put your whole strength into it."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヤドも一緒にどう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga, why don't you join in?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わ、私は――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はっ！\u3000はっ！\u3000はーっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ha! Ha! Haaa!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ/鏑矢",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp/Kaburaya"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふっ……！\u3000鏑矢様、さすがのキレです。\nベップ様とヤドヴィガ様も、素敵です",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehe...! You've got remarkable form, Kaburaya. And you too, Bepp and Jadwiga—it's wonderful."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "千歳",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chitose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これを見せられたヤンネさんは、\nいったいどうしろと……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "When Janne sees this, what on earth is she supposed to do...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わっ！\u3000な、なに！？\u3000今の声！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoa! Wh-what was that sound?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っ……！\u3000この気配は……！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...! That presence...!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤドヴィガ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Jadwiga"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]